kind: llman.sdd.spec
name: "layer-architecture"
purpose: "TBD - created by archiving change c225-refactor-domain-layering. Update purpose after archive."
valid_scope[2]: src/,tests/
requirements[25]{req_id,title,statement}:
  la1,"core-layer","System MUST provide a base domain/ layer hosting domain vocabulary types including AgentMessage and ModelKind and XyChunk and ALL pure data types consumed by two or more layers (such as SessionEntry variants, SourceInfo, SkillInfo, PromptTemplate, CompactionSettings, AgentLifecycleEvent). System MUST provide a separate runtime_protocol/ layer hosting the trait contracts (XyModel, XyTool, SessionStore, EventSink, SandboxEngine, BashExecutor, SecretResolver, ResourceLoader, TrustStore, ExportIo) so that no layer must import crate::infra merely to reference a shared data type or to declare a port."
  la2,"downward-dependency","infra/ modules MUST NOT import any crate::agent symbol; agent/ modules MUST NOT import any concrete infra/ type (only via runtime_protocol); app/ modules MUST NOT import crate::agent or crate::infra except in the documented seams: the composition roots app/cli/, app/server/, app/rpc.rs, and app/core/composition.rs (which may import both), and app/core/driver.rs (which may import agent::facade only and MUST NOT import crate::infra per la11). domain/ MUST have zero crate:: internal dependencies and runtime_protocol/ MUST only depend on domain/."
  la3,"arch-guard","System MUST enforce via a guard test that no file under src/infra imports crate::agent."
  la4,"app-layer-name","The app/ surface directory MUST contain all user-facing entry points: cli/, rpc.rs, server/, tui/, and gui.rs; cross-surface seams (composition, driver) MUST live under app/core/. The print mode MUST live under app/cli/ as a CLI sub-mode, not as a top-level app module."
  la5,"protocol-module","System MUST provide a protocol/ module as the single source of truth for client-core interaction: command enum (client to core), event enum (core to client), response envelope, and error codes."
  la6,"server-under-app","System MUST provide an app::server module (under src/app/server/) that hosts agent + infra runtimes and exposes protocol/ over REST (/api/v1) and WebSocket; the server MUST enforce a single-instance lock."
  la7,"runtime-residence","All runtimes (provider, tool, session storage, exec-env, bash executor, secret resolution, resource loader, export I/O) MUST live under infra/; agent/ MUST hold them only as Arc<dyn Port> injected at the composition root from runtime_protocol/; agent/ MUST NOT call any infra constructor or borrow infra exec primitives directly."
  la8,"agent-independence","The Agent (capability aggregate) constructor MUST NOT require a Session, MUST NOT hold a session_id, and MUST NOT depend on Session persistence lifecycle; session_id is a SessionStore query key bound in the app layer. The former facade wording is reconciled because the agent::facade hub is removed by c320."
  la9,"arch-guard-expanded","The architecture guard MUST enforce via a guard test (src/tests.rs::arch_guard) all of: no infra file imports crate::agent, no agent file imports ANY concrete crate::infra type via a full scan of crate::infra:: in production code, and no app file imports crate::agent or crate::infra except the documented seams (app/cli/, app/server/, app/rpc.rs, app/core/composition.rs, and app/core/driver.rs); the scan scope MUST reconcile with la2."
  la10,"note-convention","Deliberate simplifications MUST be marked with a tool-agnostic comment of the form '// NOTE: <what>. ceiling: <when it breaks>. upgrade: <trigger>.' so they can be grepped and reaped."
  la11,"arch-guard-app","The architecture guard MUST verify that app/ modules (excluding the documented seams: app/cli/, app/server/, app/rpc.rs, app/core/composition.rs, and app/core/driver.rs) do not import crate::agent or crate::infra types; app/core/driver.rs MUST additionally be verified to contain no crate::infra import."
  la12,"arch-guard-allowlist","System MUST maintain a documented allowlist of pre-existing agent to infra import violations inside arch_guard; each allowlist entry MUST cite a follow-up change id that will remove it, and any NEW agent to infra production import not present in the allowlist MUST fail the guard."
  la13,"agent-thin-no-presentation","agent/ MUST NOT host pure presentation or user-guidance logic such as static help text or message formatting; such logic MUST live under app/ (the client surface), and agent/ MUST contain only the orchestration loop, hook points, and orchestration state."
  la14,"no-core-rename-shim","System MUST NOT retain a pub use domain as core backward-compatibility shim; all call sites MUST be updated to crate::domain in one pass."
  la15,"app-composition","System MUST provide an app::core::composition module that centralizes construction of a fully wired Agent from BuildAgentOptions so that CLI, RPC, Server, and TUI do not duplicate Agent wiring code."
  la16,"xy-domain-types","domain layer MUST host Xy-prefixed core abstractions and remove duplicate types."
  la17,"xy-protocol-ports","runtime_protocol layer MUST host Xy-prefixed port contracts and signature types."
  la18,"event-layering",XyEvent MUST live in domain and XyEventSink in runtime_protocol and EventBus in infra.
  la19,"seam-surface-separation","app/ MUST group its cross-surface seams under src/app/core/: the composition root (composition.rs) and the runtime driver boundary (driver.rs) MUST both live under app/core/, separate from self-contained application surfaces (cli/, rpc.rs, server/, tui/, gui.rs). Application surfaces MUST NOT host build_agent wiring or the Driver trait directly."
  la20,"shared-bootstrap-and-dispatch","app::core MUST host a shared bootstrap module (app::core::bootstrap) centralizing the full assembly path from CLI args to a constructed AgentRuntime (config load, ModelRegistry build, trust resolution, resource discovery including templates/context_files/system_prompt/append_system_prompt, compaction settings, permission, build_agent, model select), and a shared dispatch module (app::core::dispatch) centralizing Command variant execution semantics; print (cli), server, and tui MUST call bootstrap, rpc and tui MUST call dispatch, and no surface MAY inline its own assembly or command-dispatch implementation."
  la21,禁止死包装协作者,agent/ 内对端口的纯转发壳（无附加状态或行为，且无生产调用方）MUST 删除；Agent MUST 直接持有 Arc<dyn Port> 或经有真实职责的协作者访问，MUST NOT 保留 SessionIO 类零逻辑包装。
  "la-embed1","嵌入禁止 reach-in",嵌入路径 MUST 仅依赖精选 Xy 契约与文档化应用缝；MUST NOT 要求嵌入方 import infra 具体实现或 agent 子模块内部类型以完成标准装配。
  "la-server-driver",Server 与 Print 同缝,Server 与 Print MUST 共享同一应用缝（Driver/bootstrap）；新增 server 能力时优先扩缝，禁止为 server 单独复制一套 agent 编排。
  "la-mcp-seam",组合根消化 MCP 配置,"composition/McpSession MUST 在缝边界内将嵌入缝 MCP 描述转为 infra 实现；应用面 MUST NOT 为 MCP 装配单独 reach-in infra 类型。"
  "la-dispatch-consume",dispatch 有消费方,跨面命令执行缝 dispatch MUST 至少被一个生产应用面消费（Server 或 TUI）；禁止长期仅单测覆盖而无面接线。
scenarios[26]{req_id,id,given,when,then}:
  la1,"shared-types-in-domain",a pure data type is needed by both agent/ and infra/,the type is declared and imported,"both layers import it from crate::domain and runtime_protocol from crate::runtime_protocol"
  la2,"app-layer-isolated","","a new file under src/app/core/driver.rs imports crate::infra::tools::BashTool",the architecture guard fails and reports the violation
  la2,"composition-root-allowed","","a file under src/app/core/composition.rs imports crate::infra::tools::default_tools",the architecture guard allows it as a documented composition root
  la3,"guard-catches-violation","a new src/infra file adds use crate::agent::session",the architecture guard runs,the guard fails and reports the offending file path
  la4,"app-dir-exists","",the source tree is inspected after the refactor,src/app exists and src/interactive no longer exists
  la5,"protocol-commands",a client sends a command to the core,the command is serialized,"it deserializes into the protocol::Command enum defined in protocol/"
  la6,"server-dir-moved","",the source tree is inspected after the refactor,src/app/server exists and src/server no longer exists
  la7,"executor-not-in-agent",the bash executor is located,its source file is inspected,it lives under infra/ and agent/ reaches it only via an injected port
  la8,"facade-wording-reconciled",la8 previously referenced the Agent facade constructor,the requirement is read after the change,it refers to the Agent capability aggregate constructor and still forbids requiring a Session or holding a session_id
  la9,"guard-scans-app","","a new app/ file outside the documented seams imports crate::agent",the architecture guard fails and reports the offending file path
  la10,"note-greppable",a deliberate simplification is made in code,the author marks it,"the line contains '// NOTE: ... ceiling: ... upgrade: ...' and is grep-findable"
  la11,"driver-is-clean","",app/core/driver.rs is scanned for infra imports,"it contains no crate::infra import"
  la12,"allowlist-blocks-new-violations","an agent file adds a NEW crate::infra import not listed in the allowlist",the guard runs,the build fails and the message names the file and says it is not in the allowlist
  la13,"auth-guidance-not-in-agent","the source tree is inspected for user-guidance message formatting functions",src/agent/ is scanned,"no pure presentation or static help-text module (such as the former agent::auth guidance) remains under agent/"
  la14,"no-shim",the source tree is grepped for backward shims,the grep runs,"zero matches for pub use domain as core or similar re-exports"
  la15,"composition-reused","","CLI, RPC, and Server each need an Agent","all three call app::core::composition::build_agent instead of duplicating wiring code"
  la16,"xy-domain-types",public domain type is external,the change is applied,it is renamed to Xy and imported consistently
  la17,"xy-protocol-ports",runtime_protocol trait is referenced,the change is applied,it is renamed to Xy and implemented by infra
  la18,"event-layer-check",event types and ports are located,src is inspected,XyEvent is in domain and XyEventSink is in runtime_protocol
  la19,"seams-under-core","",the source tree is inspected,"composition.rs and driver.rs live under app/core/, and no Driver-trait or build_agent seam lives directly under a surface directory (cli/, rpc.rs, server/, tui/, gui.rs)"
  la20,"bootstrap-agent-runtime",bootstrap 完成,检查 BootstrappedAgent 字段,持有 AgentRuntime（或经 Driver 封装）
  la21,"no-session-io","",搜索 SessionIO 与 PermissionGate 生产调用,类型已删除或不再作为无逻辑壳存在
  "la-embed1","no-reach-in","",按嵌入文档装配 agent,"调用点不出现 crate::infra:: 或 agent::session:: 路径（测试双除外）"
  "la-server-driver","shared-seam","",对比 print 与 server 装配,二者均经 composition/bootstrap 与 Driver 语义
  "la-mcp-seam","composition-owns","","审查 McpSession::reload 签名",参数为缝类型；infra 转换仅在 composition/infra 内
  "la-dispatch-consume","server-wires","",c550 归档后审查调用点,server REST 生产路径调用 dispatch
